expression: "help(&[\"invoke\", \"--help\"])"
---
Invoke a previously deployed function by id

Usage: tensor-wasm invoke [OPTIONS] --server <SERVER> <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>  Identifier of the deployed function to invoke

Options:
      --server <SERVER>  Base URL of the target TensorWasm server (e.g. `http://localhost:8080`)
      --tenant <TENANT>  Tenant id to advertise on outbound API requests via `X-TensorWasm-Tenant`. Zero (the default) suppresses the header for backwards compatibility [default: 0]
      --args <ARGS>      Arguments forwarded to the function, encoded as a JSON array
  -h, --help             Print help
